/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 309 0 R
/E (A live analytics dashboard, built with Chart.js, consolidates each learner's video-watch history, quiz score trends, and study streaks, along with a stage-advancement suggestion engine based on recent performance. To ensure reliability during demos and real-world use, I integrated the YouTube Data API v3 and the Judge0 code-execution API with automatic offline fallbacks, so the platform remains fully functional even without external API access. The project also includes a curated directory of free courses from Coursera, Udemy, Infosys Springboard, and NPTEL, and a built-in autosaving notepad with one-click download support, rounding out a complete, self-contained learning environment built entirely from scratch.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
