/S /P
/P 310 0 R
/E (I designed and developed a full-stack, browser-based Smart Attendance and Emotion Analytics System that automates student attendance marking using real-time face recognition through a standard webcam, while simultaneously detecting and logging the emotional state of each recognized individual. The entire system operates on local hardware without any GPU, cloud subscription, or internet connection, making it practically deployable in any educational institution with just a laptop and a webcam.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
