<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 323 0 R
/E (I evaluated the system across 1,350 test frames recorded over five separate sessions on different days with three enrolled subjects, introducing natural variation in lighting, pose, and appearance. The face recognition module achieved a macro-average precision of 94.73%, recall of 93.26%, and an F1-score of 93.99%. The emotion classification CNN achieved a weighted F1-score of 87.4% across all seven emotion classes, with Neutral and Happy performing best at 93.3% and 90.4% respectively. The end-to-end pipeline ran at approximately 20.5 frames per second on an Intel Core i5 11th Generation CPU with no GPU acceleration. I also authored a complete IEEE-format research paper documenting the system architecture, the CLAHE preprocessing methodology, the experimental setup, and the full precision, recall, and F1-score evaluation results for both the face recognition and emotion classification components.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
